=============================================================//==============================================================================//===================
⏰ CLOCK MASTER
=============================================================//==================≈==========================================/======================================================================================================================================================================
Smart Time Management & Study Productivity System

CLOCK MASTER is a Python-based time management application developed using Jupyter Notebook. It is designed to help users manage their daily time efficiently by combining essential clock utilities with smart study planning and productivity tracking features.

The application provides a simple menu-driven interface that allows users to access different time management tools in one place.

=============================================================//===============================================================================//==================
📌 Project Overview
=============================================================//===============================================================================//==================
Time management plays an important role in maintaining productivity and organizing daily activities.

CLOCK MASTER aims to make time management easier by providing multiple useful features, including a digital clock, alarm clock, stopwatch, countdown timer, and additional study productivity tools.

Along with basic clock functionalities, the project introduces a Smart Study Planner and Productivity Statistics to help users organize their study sessions and monitor their learning time.

=============================================================//===============================================================================//==================
✨ Features
=============================================================//===============================================================================//==================
1. Digital Clock

- Displays the current date and time.
- Updates every second.
- Uses a 12-hour time format with AM/PM.
- Allows users to stop the clock.

2. Alarm Clock

- Add alarms with custom names and times.
- View all saved alarms.
- Delete existing alarms.
- Monitor scheduled alarm times.
- Displays an alarm notification when the scheduled time is reached while monitoring is active.

3. Stopwatch

- Measures elapsed time.
- Supports lap recording through user input.
- Displays total elapsed time when stopped.

4. Countdown Timer

- Allows users to set a timer in minutes.
- Displays the remaining time.
- Shows a completion message when the countdown ends.

5. Smart Study Planner (USP)

- Enter a subject and topic to study.
- Set a study duration.
- Start a focused study session.
- Automatically records completed study sessions.
- Helps users organize their study activities.

6. Productivity Statistics (USP)

- Displays the total number of completed study sessions.
- Calculates total study time.
- Displays total study hours.
- Provides a daily productivity summary.

=============================================================//===============================================================================//==================
🌟 Unique Selling Points (USP)
=============================================================//==================
Unlike a basic clock application, CLOCK MASTER combines everyday time management tools with study productivity features.

Its two additional features make it more useful:

Smart Study Planner: Allows users to plan and complete subject-wise study sessions with a selected duration.

Productivity Statistics: Provides information about completed study sessions and total study time, helping users monitor their study activity.

These features make CLOCK MASTER more than just a basic clock application.

