=============================================================//===============================================================================//===============================================================================//==================
⚙️ How to Run the Project
=============================================================//===============================================================================//===============================================================================//==================
Prerequisites

- Python 3.x
- Jupyter Notebook

Step 1: Install Jupyter Notebook

If Jupyter Notebook is not already installed, run:

!pip install notebook

Step 2: Open Jupyter Notebook

Launch Jupyter Notebook and create a new Python notebook.

Step 3: Add the Project Code

Copy the CLOCK MASTER source code into a notebook cell.

Step 4: Run the Code

Execute the cell to start the application.

The main menu will appear, allowing users to select different features.

